# Installed hook artifacts, not sources. husky is no longer a dependency, but it left
# core.hooksPath pointing here on some machines. The hook SOURCES live in
# scripts/git-hooks/; `npm run hooks:install` copies them into whichever directory git
# actually reads. Nothing in .husky/ should be edited or committed.
.husky/

